00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:57.700
the woman says to the

00:04:57.700 --> 00:04:59.800
God never forbid me to

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:01.400
eat from all the trees

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:04.780
we may eat from

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:07.020
the trees of the garden

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:08.380
only

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:13.080
only from

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:14.960
